# retired only when its bytes match a known repository version. The two JSON
# candidates were rendered with the operator HOME by the historical installer;
# their immutable templates live in paseo/legacy so classification never needs
# the repository's Git history. A customized file, private notebook, or
# redirecting link is retained and called out in the plan/result.
